  "question": {
    "text": "The most common oxidation state of Lanthanoid elements is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math>. Which of the following is likely to deviate easily from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;oxidation state?"
